        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly your Cosmic Cat to their comfy green bed to complete each level.  There are a total 216 levels filled with a wide variety of challenges.  These are split up into a main campaign (120 levels), a Training Mode (12 levels), a bonus campaign Cosmic Kitten (60 levels), and 6 levels for each season themed levels (Spring, Summer, Autumn &amp; Winter Festivals).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/ff57ee68899d52ba61a4ccf7f6d3c894.poster.avif?t=1781542171\" width=426 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/ff57ee68899d52ba61a4ccf7f6d3c894.webm?t=1781542171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >144 Hidden Collectable Cards to find:  For you level explorers out there, each main level has a collectable card based on a something in the game. They will be easy to find in the beginning but will become harder to find later in secret areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/06aa3684a8b49b1b250c19bb5d6e5573.poster.avif?t=1781542171\" width=426 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/06aa3684a8b49b1b250c19bb5d6e5573.webm?t=1781542171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★  <strong>Gold Stars  →  Unlock Playable Cats:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing a level fast enough and you'll be rewarded a Gold Star to unlock a random Cosmic Cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Training Mode levels will award you a Gold Star and an Arcade Coin for completing it, regardless of how long you take.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★  <strong>Silver Stars  →  Arcade Coins:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish a level at a decent pace and you'll be rewarded a Silver Star, you'll be rewarded with an Arcade Coin, which you can save up to spend to unlock 5 different arcade minigames (Cat Flap, Cat Walker, Catcher, Catapult and Cats Eye) and also an extra 60 levels in the 2nd campaign (Cosmic Kitten).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★  <strong>Bronze Stars  →  Progression:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't want to race against the clock, you can switch off or ignore the timer using the Pause menu options during the level or press T on the Keyboard.  Take as long as you want and you can still earn a Bronze Star which unlocks the next level until you complete the game.  If you lose all your 9 lives twice, you'll be able to skip the level and try the next one, so you can enjoy the rest of the game and come back to them at your own leisure.  When you complete one of the campaigns, you'll unlock a Speedrunning mode where you can play all the way through and get a total time for a campaign.  You can quit the Speedrun after any level and it will save your progress so you can continue after as many breaks as you like and the game will save your current Speedrun time for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/fc30e3ba5c98d3b91f66b2a96f60d316.avif?t=1781542171\" width=800 height=449 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start your Cosmic Cat journey now and join the fun!</h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly your Cosmic Cat to their comfy green bed to complete each level.  There are a total 216 levels filled with a wide variety of challenges.  These are split up into a main campaign (120 levels), a Training Mode (12 levels), a bonus campaign Cosmic Kitten (60 levels), and 6 levels for each season themed levels (Spring, Summer, Autumn &amp; Winter Festivals).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/ff57ee68899d52ba61a4ccf7f6d3c894.poster.avif?t=1781542171\" width=426 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/ff57ee68899d52ba61a4ccf7f6d3c894.webm?t=1781542171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >144 Hidden Collectable Cards to find:  For you level explorers out there, each main level has a collectable card based on a something in the game. They will be easy to find in the beginning but will become harder to find later in secret areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/06aa3684a8b49b1b250c19bb5d6e5573.poster.avif?t=1781542171\" width=426 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/06aa3684a8b49b1b250c19bb5d6e5573.webm?t=1781542171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★  <strong>Gold Stars  →  Unlock Playable Cats:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing a level fast enough and you'll be rewarded a Gold Star to unlock a random Cosmic Cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Training Mode levels will award you a Gold Star and an Arcade Coin for completing it, regardless of how long you take.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★  <strong>Silver Stars  →  Arcade Coins:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish a level at a decent pace and you'll be rewarded a Silver Star, you'll be rewarded with an Arcade Coin, which you can save up to spend to unlock 5 different arcade minigames (Cat Flap, Cat Walker, Catcher, Catapult and Cats Eye) and also an extra 60 levels in the 2nd campaign (Cosmic Kitten).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★  <strong>Bronze Stars  →  Progression:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't want to race against the clock, you can switch off or ignore the timer using the Pause menu options during the level or press T on the Keyboard.  Take as long as you want and you can still earn a Bronze Star which unlocks the next level until you complete the game.  If you lose all your 9 lives twice, you'll be able to skip the level and try the next one, so you can enjoy the rest of the game and come back to them at your own leisure.  When you complete one of the campaigns, you'll unlock a Speedrunning mode where you can play all the way through and get a total time for a campaign.  You can quit the Speedrun after any level and it will save your progress so you can continue after as many breaks as you like and the game will save your current Speedrun time for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/fc30e3ba5c98d3b91f66b2a96f60d316.avif?t=1781542171\" width=800 height=449 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start your Cosmic Cat journey now and join the fun!</h2>",
        "short_description": "Pilot 156 Cosmic Cats across 216 vibrant 3D side-scrolling levels packed with varied enemies, obstacles, weapons, and abilities. Find hidden collectible cards, or race for best times to earn stars that unlock cats, minigames, and the Cosmic Kitten bonus campaign.",
